{"id":"comandante","lemma":"comandante","pos":"noun","rank":824,"glosses":["commander"],"ipa":"/komanˈdante/","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"comandantes","feminine":"comandante","femininePlural":"comandantes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-comandante.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom fue un comandante de tanques.","en":"Tom was a tank commander.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803590","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"tank","l":"tanque"}]},{"text":"Los soldados deben obedecer a sus comandantes.","en":"Soldiers must obey their commanders.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"soldier","l":"soldado"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to obey"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Un comandante tuvo que tomar el mando de la división.","en":"A major had to take command of the division.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"command"},null,null,{"g":"division, divide"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"of the"]]},{"text":"El comandante se rehusó a negociar.","en":"The commander refused to negotiate.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to refuse","l":"rehusar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to negotiate"}]},{"text":"El comandante británico fue forzado a rendirse.","en":"The British commander was forced to surrender.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"British"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"forced, forcible"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to conquer","l":"rendir"}]}]}